                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Maybe you, like me loved the first one, and maybe you like silly FMV adventure games. I'm here to tell you  DON'T DO IT.  This has none of the magic of the first one, and is an absolute mess to play. Extremely bad  adventure puzzle logic that never makes any sense and just gets worse by the end of the game. Game is also extremely buggy and just a DOSBox wrapper, so you will just randomly crash in the middle of a scene sometimes. On top of that, the story itself is nuts.\r\nAll in all it's like watching a bad 90s movie except its 8 hours long and the VCR keeps breaking down and you have to solve arbitrary puzzles to fix it.",
